Yes. We should consider standardizing the output of the report functions. gl.report.heterozygosity outputs the heterozygosities, but gl.report.callrate does not output the callrate values.That would make it easier for the users.

Alternatively, we could automatically add some individual metrics to the genlight object, which would include callrate.

A

